                    <p class="mb-1"><span class="text-warning">Expert Informatique et Systèmes d'Information <strong>(EISI)</strong></span>, <span class="fst-italic text-body-secondary">éqval. RNCP+7</span></p>
                    <p class="mb-1"><span class="text-success">Bachelor Concepteur-Développeur d'Applications <strong>(CDA)</strong></span>, <span class="fst-italic text-body-secondary">éqvl. RNCP+6</span></p>
                    <p class="mb-1"><span class="text-success-emphasis">BTS SIO Option DEV</span>, <span class="fst-italic text-body-secondary">éqvl. RNCP+5</span></p>
                    <p class="mb-1"><span>Bac Scientifique SVT Option Mathématiques</span>, <span class="fst-italic text-body-secondary">Mention Bien</span></p>
                    <p class="mb-1"><span class="text-secondary-emphasis">PET de Cambridge</span>, <span class="fst-italic text-body-secondary"> éqvl. Anglais B2</span></p>
                </div>
                <hr class="ms-3 mt-3 mb-2">
                <div class="ms-2 mt-0 ps-1">
                    <h3>Compétences</h3>
                    <p class="m-0">Développement</p>
                    <p class="m-0 lh-sm text-body-secondary"><small>Python (Django, Flask), C# (.NET Frmwk), PHP (Laravel, Symfony), HTML/CSS/JS (Bootstrap), MySQL, PostgreSQL</small></p>
